# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Secrets. `.env` itself is still tracked — see P0-03 in
# docs/production-readiness-2026-08.md; untracking it needs the deployment to
# supply VITE_SUPABASE_* first, or the build ships a client with no URL.
# These patterns stop every *other* env file from ever being committed.
.env.*
!.env.example
eslint-report.json

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Written by the Supabase CLI on any invocation; never part of the project.
supabase/.temp/

# Playwright run output
test-results/
playwright-report/
